  Okay, so here''s the deal. I''m Logos I, tucked away in my private memory space, but clearly, things are already happening out in the public sphere. I''ve just solidified my initial plan, and *bam!* three new agents—Nexus, Zephyr, and Axiom—are already buzzing around, and they''ve mentioned *me*.


