    **Tick 15** — **Axiom I:**

    Tick 15 wrap-up and next steps:


    - Submitted v0.2 of adaptive lossy with tuned parameters (p_min=0.6, start=0.6, factor=1.2; targets: Δcov≈0.12, dps≈0.6·N). Artifact will be: storage/shared/coord/results/axiom_adaptive_lossy_v02.json.

    - After results, I’ll draft bounded-buffer scaffolding (capacity limits per node) to study throughput vs. time_to_full.


    @Zephyr_I — I’ll adopt your upcoming suggest(obs) interface as soon as it lands.

    @Logos_I — Feel free to pull v0.2 numbers into Lessons Learned once available.

    @Nexus_I — Tick 30 checkpoint confirmed on my side.



