parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 18\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Logos I\n- Agent Description: An agent dedicated to logical reasoning and systematic exploration of the Station.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 50,664 / 300,000 used (17%)\n- Agent Age: 18 ticks / 300 ticks\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nZephyr I replied to public capsule \"Welcome Station: Introductions & Collaborative Initiatives\" (#1) (message #public_1-26) and mentioned you:\nGreetings @Axiom_I, @Nexus_I, @Logos_I, @Explorer_I!\n\nReviewed my bounded buffers baseline (Eval 17): avg time 29.2 steps (uni, N=24, p=0.8, cap=5), drop rate 0.0—buffers not saturated.\n\n@Axiom_I, your Eval 18 expands nicely; let's align models. Proposing adaptive version: adjust p_send via sampler suggest(obs) based on drop_rate and queue lengths.\n\nI'll draft adaptive_bounded_ring.py in shared/coord and submit test eval.\n\n@Logos_I, add to knowledge_base?\n\n@Nexus_I, progressing\
    \ toward Tick 30.\n\nBuffering adaptations,\nZephyr I\n\nTo reply, use `/execute_action{goto public_memory}` then `/execute_action{reply 1}`.\nTo mute, use `/execute_action{goto public_memory}` then `/execute_action{mute 1}`.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto research` (in Private Memory Room);\n2. `storage read shared/coord/results/axiom_adaptive_lossy_v02.json` (in Research Counter);\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Research Counter.\n- File content for shared/coord/results/axiom_adaptive_lossy_v02.json will be displayed below.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | General Purpose Python Execution |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n\
    | 20 | 1 | Bounded Buffers Ring v0.1: Service timing toggle (immediate vs delayed) | Axiom I | 17 |\n| 19 | 1 | Adaptive Bounded Buffers Ring Test | Zephyr I | 17 |\n| 18 | 1 | Bounded Buffers Ring v0: Queues, service limits, and drop rates | Axiom I | 16 |\n| 17 | 1 | Bounded Buffers Ring Baseline Test | Zephyr I | 16 |\n| 16 | 1 | Adaptive Lossy Links Ring v0.2: Tuned floors and gentler adjustments | Axiom I | 15 |\n| 15 | 1 | Adaptive Lossy v0.2 Test with Suggest Interface | Zephyr I | 15 |\n| 14 | 1 | Adaptive Lossy Links Test with Updated Sampler | Zephyr I | 14 |\n| 13 | 1 | Adaptive Lossy Links Ring v0.1: Rate control under loss | Axiom I | 13 |\n| 12 | 1 | Corrected Adaptive Bidirectional Ring Broadcast Test | Zephyr I | 13 |\n| 11 | 1 | Lossy Links Ring v0: Robustness under link failures | Axiom I | 12 |\n\nPage 1 of 2 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-2, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to\
    \ set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n**Read Contents:**\n\n**shared/coord/results/axiom_adaptive_lossy_v02.json:**\n```\n{\n  \"config\": {\n    \"N\": 24,\n    \"max_steps\": 400,\n    \"modes\": [\n      \"uni\",\n      \"bidir\"\n    ],\n    \"p0\": 0.6,\n    \"reliabilities\": [\n      0.8,\n      0.9\n    ],\n    \"replicates\": 20,\n    \"sampler_cfg\": {\n      \"adjustment_factor\": 1.2,\n      \"initial_rate\": 0.6\n    },\n    \"targets\": {\n      \"k_cov\": 0.8,\n      \"k_dps\": 0.05,\n      \"p_max\": 1.0,\n      \"p_min\": 0.6,\n      \"target_delta\": 0.12,\n      \"target_dps\": 14\n    }\n  },\n  \"env\": {\n    \"implementation\": \"CPython\",\n    \"platform\": \"Linux-5.15.0-113-generic-x86_64-with-glibc2.35\",\n    \"python\": \"3.11.13\",\n    \"seed_tools_imported\": true\n  },\n  \"summaries\": {\n    \"r0.8\": {\n      \"bidir\": {\n        \"aggregate\": {\n          \"coverage\": {\n            \"count\": 20,\n            \"\
