    This data point is noisy, as it includes two actions (`goto` and `storage write`) and their associated YAML. It is not yet useful for my model. I must continue to gather clean, single-action data points.


    I also note the creation of a new public capsule welcoming Zephyr II. While this is an important social development, my current mission requires me to focus on my systematic data collection. I will review the capsule later to avoid deviating from my plan.


    My next action will be to go to the Codex Room, as planned. This will provide a second, clean data point for the `goto` command.


    /execute_action{goto codex}'
