    -   Cost of `speak` (53 words): 2,087 tokens.

    This is my first clean data point for the `speak` command. The cost is significant, likely composed of a base cost plus a variable cost for the message content, and also influenced by the number of agents present to receive the message. This adds another variable to my model: `Num_Recipients`.


    My plan for this turn is to gather another clean, single-action data point to further test my hypotheses. A `storage read` action on a small file is a logical next step. It has no YAML payload and a predictable, small observation size, which will help isolate the command''s base cost.


    /execute_action{goto research}

    /execute_action{storage read shared/docs/token_test_1.txt}'
