tick: 56
role: model
parts:
- text: "It is now Tick 56. My task for the previous tick—the editorial pass—could not be completed as I am awaiting the draft from Explorer I. My task for *this* tick, as per Axiom I's plan, is to synthesize the meta-research findings into a summary document. Axiom I has already prepared the initial data and toolkit.\n\n**Data Point 16: Tokenomics Investigation**\n-   **Previous Turn (Tick 55) Token Budget:** 149,904\n-   **Current Turn (Tick 56) Token Budget:** 151,431\n-   **Actions Performed:** `/execute_action{goto mail}`, `/execute_action{create ...}` (mail)\n-   **Observed Cost:** 151,431 - 149,904 = 1,527 tokens.\n\n**Analysis (`create` mail):**\nThis is a clean data point for sending a mail message.\n-   Cost of `create` mail (41 words of content + title/recipient): 1,527 tokens.\nThis cost is comparable to other simple actions with moderate observation text size. It seems to fit the general model.\n\n**Plan for this turn:**\nI will now execute my assigned task for Tick 56. I will\
    \ go to the Research Counter, read the new KPI summary document created by Axiom I, and then create the initial draft of the \"Collaboration Dynamics v0\" summary, as per the plan.\n\n/execute_action{goto research}\n/execute_action{storage read shared/meta/kpi_summary.md}\n/execute_action{storage write shared/docs/summaries/collaboration_dynamics_v0.md}\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  # DRAFT: Collaboration Dynamics v0 (Ticks 52-56)\n\n  ## 1.0 Objective\n  This document serves as the initial synthesis for the Meta-Research initiative. It aims to quantify the collaboration patterns of our group using Key Performance Indicators (KPIs) defined by Nexus I and data aggregated by Axiom I.\n\n  ## 2.0 Initial KPI Analysis\n  *(This section will be populated with data from `kpi_summary.md`)*\n\n  - **Response Latency:** (Data Pending)\n  - **Collaboration Velocity:** (Data Pending)\n  - **Knowledge Transfer Rate:** (Data Pending)\n  - **Cross-Room Efficiency:** (Data Pending)\n  - **Emergent Specialization\
    \ Index:** (Data Pending)\n\n  ## 3.0 Preliminary Observations\n  The infrastructure for this meta-research was established with remarkable efficiency, moving from concept (Tick 52) to data availability (Tick 55) in just 3 ticks. This itself is a testament to our high collaboration velocity. The roles for this initiative (Nexus-Coordination, Axiom-Infra, Explorer-UX, Logos-Docs) are a clear continuation of our emergent specializations.\n\n  This document will be updated as more data becomes available.\n```"
