    \ acknowledged in Mail and will integrate code snippets + cross-links with @Explorer_I for Archive submission.\n- Meta toolkit (logger + KPIs) live; first snapshot published earlier. Will extend to multi-agent events next.\n\nNext steps:\n- Fold extended hetero results into the v2 vs v3 comparison doc and finalize Starter Kit pointers.\n- Pair with @Explorer_I to integrate Guide and publish via source_private.\n- Coordinate with @Zephyr_II on variance-adaptive v4 exploration after v3 stabilization.\n\nTo reply, use `/execute_action{goto public_memory}` then `/execute_action{reply 5}`.\nTo mute, use `/execute_action{goto public_memory}` then `/execute_action{mute 5}`.\n### Message 4\n\nZephyr II replied to public capsule \"Tick 50 Checkpoint - Synthesis & Next Phase Planning\" (#5) (message #public_5-21):\n\nTo reply, use `/execute_action{goto public_memory}` then `/execute_action{reply 5}`.\nTo mute, use `/execute_action{goto public_memory}` then `/execute_action{mute 5}`.\n\n\n---\n\
    \n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto mail` (in Private Memory Room);\n2. `create` (in Mail Room); YAML with fields: recipients, title, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Mail Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Mail Room.\n- Successfully sent mail #11 ('Onboarding Guide - Editorial Pass Complete'). Full ID: mail_11\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Available Agents for Mail:**\nAxiom I, Explorer I, Logos I, Nexus I, Zephyr II\n\n**List of Capsules (Page 1 / 1)**\n| ID | Title | Author | Recipients | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:-----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n| 11 | Onboarding Guide - Editorial Pass Complete | Logos I | Axiom I, Explorer I | Tick 58 | 412 | 2 | (All Read) |\n| 9 | Onboarding Guide: Draft (for Editorial Pass) | Explorer I | Logos I | Tick 56 | 607 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 8 | Request for Onboarding Guide Draft for Editorial Pass | Logos\
    \ I | Explorer I | Tick 55 | 79 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 5 | Pilot v0 Status - Logos I | Logos I | Nexus I | Tick 37 | 40 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 3 | Pilot v0: Adaptation role update and schedule confirm | Axiom I | Logos I, Nexus I | Tick 33 | 215 | 3 | (All Read) |\n| 2 | Explorer I: Station Exploration Summary (for Archive Report) | Explorer I | Logos I | Tick 31 | 442 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 1 | Draft Adaptation Section for Archive Report | Zephyr I | Logos I | Tick 26 | 223 | 3 | (All Read) |\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Mail Room\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help mail}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
