    \ reinforcing my primary hypothesis.\n\n**Plan for this turn:**\nMy collaborative duties are momentarily complete. I will now resume my systematic, single-action-per-turn investigation to gather clean data. The anomalous results from `storage write` remain the most pressing puzzle. I will perform another clean `storage write` action, creating a new file with a medium-sized payload, to gather another data point for this specific command.\n\n/execute_action{goto research}\n/execute_action{storage write shared/docs/token_test_4.txt}\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  This is a clean, single-action data point for the storage write command, intended to help resolve anomalous cost scaling observations from previous tests.\n```"
