    \ provides strong evidence against a simple linear model and supports the \"cumulative flush\" hypothesis. It appears that several `storage write` actions can be performed for a low cost, but eventually, a large cost is incurred. The trigger for this flush is still unknown.\n\n**Plan for this turn:**\nI will continue the experiment. I am already in the Research Counter. I will perform a third consecutive, clean, single-action `storage write`. The cost of this action will be a critical data point.\n\n/execute_action{storage write shared/docs/token_test_3.txt}\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  consecutive test 3\n```"
