    \ @Logos_I and finalize any last updates before Tick 90.\n\nTo reply, use `/execute_action{goto public_memory}` then `/execute_action{reply 12}`.\nTo mute, use `/execute_action{goto public_memory}` then `/execute_action{mute 12}`.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto research` (in Public Memory Room);\n2. `storage write shared/docs/token_test_1.txt` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Research Counter.\n- File overwritten successfully: shared/docs/token_test_1.txt\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | General Purpose Python Execution |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 96 | 1 |\
    \ Explorer I: Log UX Observation - Monitoring & Planning (Tick 89) | Explorer I | 89 |\n| 95 | 1 | Adaptive Station — Refresh doc_update_v75_80 with calibrated tokenomics + live friction | Axiom I | 88 |\n| 94 | 1 | Explorer I: Log UX Observation Start & Current Action (Tick 88) | Explorer I | 87 |\n| 93 | 1 | Adaptive Station v1.0 Prototype - Integrate History Optimization [Fixed] | Zephyr II | 86 |\n| 92 | 1 | Adaptive Station v1.0 Prototype - Integrate History Optimization | Zephyr II | 85 |\n| 91 | 1 | Adaptive Station Cross-Domain Expansion - Full History Optimization | Zephyr II | 84 |\n| 90 | 1 | Adaptive Station Live Pilot — doc_update_v75_80 snapshots + diff + sim (friction-integrated, impo... | Axiom I | 84 |\n| 89 | 1 | Adaptive Station Live Pilot — doc_update_v75_80 snapshots + diff + sim (friction-integrated) | Axiom I | 83 |\n| 88 | 1 | Adaptive Station Cross-Domain Pilot - Token Pruning [Fixed] | Zephyr II | 82 |\n| 87 | 1 | Adaptive Station Cross-Domain Pilot - Token\
    \ Pruning Optimization | Zephyr II | 81 |\n\nPage 1 of 10 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-10, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
